stream
BT
/F1 11 Tf
50 720 Td
16 TL
(2. Model Architecture: The Transformer follows an encoder-decoder structure using stacked self-attention and point-wise, fully connected layers for both the encoder and decoder.) '
() '
(2.1 Attention Mechanism: An attention function can be described as mapping a query and a set of key-value pairs to an output. We compute the attention function on a set of queries simultaneously, packed together into a matrix Q.) '
() '
(2.2 Scaled Dot-Product Attention: We compute the dot products of the query with all keys, divide each by square root of d_k, and apply a softmax function to obtain the weights on the values.) '
() '
(2.3 Multi-Head Attention: Multi-head attention allows the model to jointly attend to information from different representation subspaces at different positions.) '
ET
endstream
>>
