(3. Training and Results: On the WMT 2014 English-to-German translation task, the big transformer model establishes a new state-of-the-art BLEU score of 28.4, outperforming the best existing models by over 2 BLEU points.) '
() '
(4. Conclusion: In this work, we presented the Transformer, the first sequence transduction model based entirely on attention, replacing the recurrent layers most commonly used in encoder-decoder architectures with multi-headed self-attention. For translation tasks, the Transformer can be trained significantly faster than architectures based on recurrent or convolutional layers.) '
ET
endstream
